			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Paraquen delivers Lanturias' requested drinks for himself and his friends with a friendly grin and expert handling of her tray. &quot;If I might, milord,&quot; staying polite as she's just beginning to recognize the new face in the tavern, &quot;There -was- a young lady looking at yon advertisement. Aye, and quite pretty she was, and dressed in robes similar to yourself, though not quite as fancy I'll wager. She seemed quite taken by the drawing...&quot; Waving her hand, she dismisses the thought, &quot;Bah, what do I know? Let me get back to the stuff of life, good drinks, good food, and tossing out dwarves who abuse my good graces. Be there anything else I can get for all of you?&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
 
<br />
<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
