			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Rithnok Sneeks up behind the barmaid and just for kicks and giggles Lays a BIG WET Iksarian Slurpie on her, &quot;Well! That's my stupid thing for this year.&quot; And preps himself for the slap or punch he may recieve. &quot;I thought with all the love going around I might just give some of mine too.&quot; The samurai chuckles and awaits his punishment.
