				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=15925&amp;sid=5cce3abb7a0c72e9100ea8178f696f01"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">At his friend's somber tone, a smile creeps across Lanturias's face. &quot;I'm sorry, Nich,  but I was only kidding. I did not write this note, and have no idea who did. As a matter of a fact, only a few minutes ago I discovered it posted on the wall up there. You have any idea who would do such a joke?&quot; 
<br />

<br />

<br />

