			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Nicholi nods in understanding and then wrinkles his brow in thought.  &quot;No, I do not know who would post such a note for you Lanturias.&quot;  He reaches over to pat his friend's shoulder and smiles.  &quot;Don't let it get you down.  Whoever put it up there is probably just quite jealous of your good looks and winning personality.  My advice would be to ignore it and continue with your studies and the pride you take in your abilities.  If you're interested in finding a special someone, be patient.  To rush such things is like rushing into battle without proper preparations.  Such battles are usually shortlived and unsuccessful.&quot; 
<br />
<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
