			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Arialana looks at Lanturias.  &quot;No no, stop right there Lanturias. What is this 'Keep your feet dry'? What exactly is the significance of that? Or is it just some sort of drunken comment from you? Besides there are times that it is hard to keep my feet dry.  What if I want to go swimming do I still have to keep them dry?&quot; Arialana chuckles. &quot;And on this matter at hand, I think we should try to figure out who posted that note. I think you would sleep much better knowing....Perhaps the poster of the note secretly has a thing for you, no? Then wouldn't you want to know whom it is? Of course then again it could have just been that prankster rogue Marcelas.&quot; Arialana chuckles and looks about the room. &quot;See the possibilities are endless, and I know I would sleep better knowing myself.&quot; Arialana smiles and waits for Lanturias' response. 
<br />
<i></i><br />_________________<br />Arialana Nightingale
<br />
Healer of the sick, Rezzer of the dead for 50 seasons
<br />
<img src="images/smiles/new_angel.gif" alt="new_angel.gif" border="0" />
<br />
Llaianya Natursangel
<br />
Preserver of the Wild for 59 seasons</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
