				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Lanturias leans down to Arialana. &quot;My lady&quot; he murmurs &quot;I am hardly drunk. Three glasses just sufficed to make me feel....pleasant. As for keeping your feet dry, well, I have found that travel is a lot more pleasant in clean dry comfortable footwear.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Lanturias sits down beside her again. &quot;How exactly do you propose we go about finding out who wrote the note, Aria? Since you seem to want to know so much...&quot; 
