			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Arialana snickers. &quot;So it takes you drinks to make you pleasant?  I'll have to remember that. I will always carry some with me on our journeys. Your topic of conversation is drastically improved as well.  As to finding the culprit. That is a good  question. Hmmmm...Perhaps a game of sleuth? We can go down to the clothing store and pick out some neat sleuthing hats.  Or we could just ask around and see if anyone saw the poster of the note. As to my curiousness, I am surprised the one affected directly by the note is not more curious. Why is that? &quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Arialana awaits Lanturias' response. 
